+  </div>
+</header>
+
+<main class="features-page">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="feat-head" style="margin-top: 30px;">
+      <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Platform Features</span>
+      <h2 style="font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 12px;">Everything you need to automate <span style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #25D366, #059669); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; font-weight: 800;">WhatsApp</span></h2>
+      <p style="font-size: 16px;">A comprehensive breakdown of all the features available in our platform.</p>
+    </div>
+
+    <div class="features-list">
+      <div class="feature-page-row odd-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">1. Unified Inbox & Messaging</span>
+          <p class="desc">Centralize all your customer interactions in one seamless interface.</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Manage all WhatsApp conversations instantly in a unified, beautiful inbox where messages are sent and received in real-time via WebSockets.</li>
+            <li>Send and receive images, documents, videos, and audio notes directly from the dashboard.</li>
+            <!-- <li>Allow multiple team members to manage conversations from the same WhatsApp numbers.</li> -->
+            <!-- <li>Save and send frequently used messages to resolve customer queries faster.</li> -->
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\inbox.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row even-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">2. Chatbot Automation</span>
+          <p class="desc">Automate your customer interactions using intelligent rule-based bots.</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Automatically start specific workflows or send replies based on exact, partial, or regex keyword matches that customers send in the chat.</li>
+            <li>Set up instantaneous automated replies for out-of-office hours, welcome messages, or common FAQs.</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\chatbot.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
