+            <li>Seamlessly synchronize your contacts directly from Google Contacts to keep your address book up to date.</li>
+            <li>Quickly add new leads or contacts manually on the fly.</li>
+            <li>Organize and segment your contacts for targeted marketing.</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\contacts.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row even-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">6. Multi-Device & Session Management</span>
+          <p class="desc">Scale your operations across multiple numbers.</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Easily link and manage multiple WhatsApp numbers and sessions from a single dashboard.</li>
+            <li>Connect WhatsApp instances instantly by scanning QR codes directly within the web UI.</li>
+            <li>Monitor the active status and connection health of all connected WhatsApp instances.</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\sessions.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row odd-row">
