+          <img src="images\dashboard.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row even-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">8. Advanced Anti-Ban Safeguards</span>
+          <p class="desc">Maximize the safety of your WhatsApp numbers and significantly reduce the risk of bans with our proprietary protection systems.</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Utilize sophisticated, hidden algorithms to process and deliver messages in the safest way possible.</li>
+            <li>Rely on industry-leading built-in safeguards that work automatically in the background to keep numbers secure during bulk operations.</li>
+            <li>Intelligently manage how interactions happen to ensure campaigns look natural and compliant with standard usage patterns.</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\antiban.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row odd-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">9. Health Monitor</span>
+          <p class="desc">A dedicated dashboard to track system vitals and keep your platform running smoothly.</p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>It tracks critical metrics like Delivery Rate, Read Rate, Reply Rate, and Stuck Rate.</li>
+            <li>It includes a visual AreaChart that plots your message performance over time (24 hours, 7 days, 30 days, or a custom date).</li>
+            <li>It identifies specific contacts whose messages have been stuck at "Sent" for more than 24 hours (dead or inactive numbers).</li>
+          </ul>
+        </div>
+        <div class="feature-image">
+          <img src="images\health.png" alt="Feature preview" style="width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; display: block; background: #f1f5f9;" />
+        </div>
+      </div>
+      <div class="feature-page-row even-row">
+        <div class="feature-text">
+          <span class="num">10. OTP Builder</span>
